:"isa-39","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"Isaiah","kjv":"to Isaiah"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"2 Kings 19:2","note":"He sent Eliakim, who was over the household, Shebna the scribe, and the elders of the priests, covered with sackcloth, to Isaiah the prophet the son of Amoz.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 3:21","note":"The sons of Hananiah: Pelatiah and Jeshaiah; the sons of Rephaiah, the sons of Arnan, the sons of Obadiah, the sons of Shecaniah.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Chronicles 26:22","note":"Now the rest of the acts of Uzziah, first and last, Isaiah the prophet, the son of Amoz, wrote.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ezra 8:7","note":"Of the sons of Elam, Jeshaiah the son of Athaliah; and with him seventy males.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Nehemiah 11:7","note":"These are the sons of Benjamin: Sallu the son of Meshullam, the son of Joed, the son of Pedaiah, the son of Kolaiah, the son of Maaseiah, the son of Ithiel…","source":"web"},{"ref":"Isaiah 1:1","note":"The vision of Isaiah the son of Amoz, which he saw concerning Judah and Jerusalem, in the days of Uzziah, Jotham, Ahaz, and Hezekiah, kings of Judah.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H3449","lemma":"יִשִּׁיָּהוּ","transliteration":"yishshiyyah","gloss":"Isshiah"},{"id":"H0384","lemma":"אִיתִיאֵל","transliteration":"itiel","gloss":"Ithiel"},{"id":"H0531","lemma":"אָמוֹץ","transliteration":"amots","gloss":"Amoz"},{"id":"H0770","lemma":"אַרְנָן","transliteration":"arnan","gloss":"Arnan"},{"id":"H1436","lemma":"גְּדַלְיָה","transliteration":"gedalyah","gloss":"Gedaliah"},{"id":"H2608","lemma":"חֲנַנְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"chananyah","gloss":"Hananiah"},{"id":"H2811","lemma":"חֲשַׁבְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"chashavyah","gloss":"Hashabiah"},{"id":"H3038","lemma":"יְדוּתוּן","transliteration":"yedutun","gloss":"Jeduthun"}],"senses":[{"id":"H3470B","gloss":"Jeshaiah","relation":"H3470B ="},{"id":"H3470G","gloss":"Jeshaiah","relation":"H3470G = a Name of"},{"id":"H3470H","gloss":"Jeshaiah","relation":"H3470H ="},{"